نید\n\nبله، داری ساختار درست را پیدا می‌کنی. با این حال، چیزی که ما می‌خواهیم ببینیم این است که قیمت به درون سطوح ما فشرده شود، مثل FL.","m":24},{"id":"enquiry_p1_25","t":"I have a question in my mind What are the specifications Flag limit Saleh Trading?\n\nFeedback","a":"yacino94","d":"18 Apr 2018 18:57","r":"Trader","n":"#25","p":1,"im":[],"fa":"سؤالی در ذهنم دارم: یک Flag limit مناسب برای معامله چه مشخصاتی دارد؟\n\nنظرتان را بگویید","m":25}],"images":[{"k":"231abde2c265779cd2979e53863e912838ef5c96","t":"assets/thumbs/231abde2c265779cd2979e53863e912838ef5c96.webp","f":"assets/images/231abde2c265779cd2979e53863e912838ef5c96.webp","w":1366,"h":577,"b":54538,"o":"231abde2c265779cd2979e53863e912838ef5c96.png","p":1,"pid":"enquiry_p1_1"},{"k":"b149521aac7cc27a2e0ea8001c2d6a4d576e5fb4","t":"assets/thumbs/b149521aac7cc27a2e0ea8001c2d6a4d576e5fb4.webp","f":"assets/images/b149521aac7cc27a2e0ea8001c2d6a4d576e5fb4.webp","w":1363,"h":555,"b":31734,"o":"b149521aac7cc27a2e0ea8001c2d6a4d576e5fb4.png","p":1,"pid":"enquiry_p1_2"},{"k":"70a1630b1af8bc80b55da022bb0c7cea9d9329ec","t":"assets/thumbs/70a1630b1af8bc80b55da022bb0c7cea9d9329ec.webp","f":"assets/images/70a1630b1af8bc80b55da022bb0c7cea9d9329ec.webp","w":1362,"h":557,"b":43782,"o":"70a1630b1af8bc80b55da022bb0c7cea9d9329ec.png","p":1,"pid":"enquiry_p1_2"},{"k":"6fdcb1783c893577dd6332a1adf485866de70223","t":"assets/thumbs/6fdcb1783c893577dd6332a1adf485866de70223.webp","f":"assets/images/6fdcb1783c893577dd6332a1adf485866de70223.webp","w":1362,"h":553,"b":49948,"o":"6fdcb1783c893577dd6332a1adf485866de70223.png","p":1,"pid":"enquiry_p1_3"},{"k":"e29bc969acda40445e00fd2ed3ce64a2ff95eaed","t":"assets/thumbs/e29bc969acda40445e00fd2ed3ce64a2ff95eaed.webp","f":"assets/images/e29bc969acda40445e00fd2ed3ce64a2ff95eaed.webp","w":1387,"h":584,"b":60046,"o":"e29bc969acda40445e00fd2ed3ce64a2ff95eaed.png","p":1,"pid":"enquiry_p1_4"},{"k":"30d930a4d3b7bfa75054f796d251c62bf3f03940","t":"assets/thumbs/30d930a4d3b7bfa75054f796d251c62bf3f03940.web